  "完成/计划": "Done / planned", "完成率": "Rate", "跳过/漏做": "Skipped / missed", "分钟 实际/计划": "Min actual / planned", "这个月还没有任务。": "No tasks this month.",
  "“计划”按周例行在本月到今天为止应出现的次数和分钟算，休息日和假期不计。完成率低于六成连续两周，多半是那一科排多了或时间不对。": "“Planned” counts how often the weekly routine should have run so far this month, excluding days off and breaks. A rate under 60% for two weeks usually means that subject is overscheduled or at the wrong time.",
  "单元进度": "Unit progress", "给单元填上“预计几周”后，这里会显示每个单元按计划还是快慢。": "Give units a number of weeks and this shows whether each is on track, ahead or behind.",
  "学前期：落后只作提示，不标红。看的是坚持（有敬拜和阅读的天数），不是进度。": "Preschool: being behind is only a hint, never red. What matters is consistency (days with worship and reading), not progress.",
  "每科": "Export", "导出本月 CSV": "Export this month as CSV",
  "出勤天数 = 有完成任务或参加了家庭敬拜的天数。伊利诺伊州不要求上报，但如果有人问起，这一页加上课程页的记录就是证据；北卡、田纳西等州的出勤要求见法规页。": "Attendance = days with a completed task or family worship. Illinois requires no reporting, but if anyone asks, this page plus the course records are your evidence; see Laws for North Carolina, Tennessee and others.",
