  "自动抓取用：中文 <b>{zh}</b>，英文 <b>{en}</b>{fb}。免费直取：和合本、新译本、当代译本；BSB、NLT、WEB、KJV、ASV。有版权的 ESV、NASB、NIV、CSB、NKJV 要经一个 Supabase Edge Function 代理（持 Crossway / API.Bible 的免费非商业密钥），在这里填地址。":
    "Auto-fetch uses Chinese <b>{zh}</b>, English <b>{en}</b>{fb}. Free and direct: CUV, CNV, CCB; BSB, NLT, WEB, KJV, ASV. Copyrighted ESV, NASB, NIV, CSB, NKJV go through a Supabase Edge Function proxy holding free non-commercial Crossway / API.Bible keys; enter its URL here.",
  "（{v} 需要代理，暂时回退到公有领域的 BSB）": " ({v} needs a proxy; using public-domain BSB for now)", "手写卡默认译本": "Default versions for hand-written cards", "抓取译本与代理": "Fetch versions & proxy",
  "学年与假期": "School Year & Breaks", "回写小月亮": "Mirror to Little Moon", "已开启：": "On: ", "未开启：": "Off: ",
