  "数据库脚本不在备份里": "Database scripts are not in the backup",
  "baby-log 仓库的 supabase/schema.sql 和 migrations 只在你的电脑上（不进 git）。电脑没了，备份文件就导不回去。请把这个文件夹手动拷到云盘或别的位置；选了云盘同步文件夹的话，可以让每次备份顺带把 .sql 一起拷进去：": "baby-log's supabase/schema.sql and migrations live only on your computer (not in git). Without them a backup can't be imported. Copy that folder to a cloud drive or elsewhere by hand; with a sync folder chosen, each backup can copy the .sql files along:",
