  "{n} 首 · 这台设备已下载 {k} 首": "{n} songs · {k} downloaded on this device", "还没有歌。放几首自己的 MP3，固定两三首就够": "No songs yet. Add a few of your own MP3s; two or three fixed ones are enough",
