  "总时长上限（分钟）": "Total cap (minutes)", "超过上限时只提醒，不拦着。每一步到时也只是震一下、进度条变色，不响铃、不自动跳步；只有最后一步到时音乐淡出。": "Going over the cap only warns. When a step’s time is up the phone just buzzes and the bar changes colour: no chime, no auto-advance. Only the last step fades the music out.",
  "经文语言": "Verse language", "中文": "Chinese", "中英都读": "Both", "每晚先读诗篇 4:8": "Read Psalm 4:8 first every night", "每晚先读诗篇 4:8 ✓": "Read Psalm 4:8 first every night ✓",
  "完成后回写小月亮": "Mirror to Little Moon when done", "完成后回写小月亮 ✓": "Mirror to Little Moon when done ✓",
  "回写 = 给每个参加的孩子在小月亮里记一条「信仰 · 家庭敬拜」（小月亮的信仰模块打开才看得到），这样睡眠记录旁边就能看到那晚做没做睡前流程。": "Mirroring writes one “Faith · family worship” record per child into Little Moon (visible once its faith module is on), so the sleep log shows which nights had the routine.",
  "安抚多过刑罚，不等于不管教：安抚是恢复安全感，管教是学习行为；两者可以同时存在，但不必用惩罚来制造平静。": "Comfort over punishment is not no discipline: comfort restores safety, discipline teaches behaviour; both can coexist, but calm need not be made by punishment.",
  "没连上云端：用的是这台设备上次保存的设置和歌单。可以照常播放，完成记录会在联网后自动补传；改设置要等联网。": "Offline: using the settings and songs last saved on this device. Playback works; tonight’s log uploads when back online; settings need a connection.",
  "歌单和完成记录需要数据库迁移 019。": "Songs and logs need database migration 019.", "流程、带领词和经文清单不受影响。": "The routine, leading words and verse list still work.",
  "点一步修改名字、分钟、放哪首歌、显示哪段文字；↑↓ 调顺序。年幼的孩子可以把某步设为跳过，不用删。": "Tap a step to change its name, minutes, song and text; ↑↓ reorder. For little ones mark a step as skipped instead of deleting it.",
  "添加步骤": "Add step", "合计约 {m} 分钟": "About {m} min in total", "上限 {cap} 分钟": "cap {cap} min", "超过了 {cap} 分钟的上限，睡前流程宜短不宜长": "over the {cap}-minute cap; bedtime should be short",
  "三段式选歌": "Three-stage song choice", "一首有歌词的敬拜歌（被爱与安慰，2–3 分钟）＋ 一首经文歌（神的话语，2–4 分钟）＋ 纯音乐（放下与休息，5–15 分钟）。歌词比旋律重要：避免让孩子把「神爱我」听成「只有乖才爱我」。音量低、屏幕关、固定比丰富重要。": "One worship song with words (loved and comforted, 2–3 min) + one scripture song (God’s word, 2–4 min) + instrumental (let go and rest, 5–15 min). Lyrics matter more than melody: don’t let “God loves me” become “only when I’m good”. Low volume, screen off, consistency over variety.",
