  "{k} 个话题 · 近 30 天记了 {n} 次": "{k} topics · {n} logged in the last 30 days", "{k} 个话题：嫉妒、焦虑、厌学、屏幕、成瘾、时事、青春期": "{k} topics: jealousy, anxiety, school reluctance, screens, addiction, current events, puberty", "{k} 种状况：打人、抢东西、顶嘴、排挤……按孩子的年龄段看，也能自己加": "{k} situations: hitting, grabbing, talking back, exclusion… by the child’s age band; add your own", "{name} 的性别（可选，让内容更贴近）": "{name}’s gender (optional, to tailor the content)", "性别（可选）": "Gender (optional)", "男孩": "Boy", "女孩": "Girl", "不设置": "Not set", "{n} 种，点开看": "{n}, tap to open", "这个年龄段较少见 / 不适用": "Uncommon at this age / not applicable", "例如 6 岁已经很少咬人。展开看也可以，里面有这个年龄段该怎么看。": "For example, biting is rare by age 6. You can still open them; each says how to read it at this age.", "这个年龄段没有特别常见的，下面是较少见的。": "Nothing especially common at this age; the less common ones are below.", "上次同步 {t}": "Last synced {t}", "从小月亮重新读取": "Reload from Little Moon", "正在同步小月亮…": "Syncing Little Moon…", "登录并进入家庭后才能读取": "Sign in and join the family to read", "读取失败：": "Read failed: ", "读取小月亮失败：": "Could not read Little Moon: ", "已同步最新小月亮记录（{n} 条）": "Synced the latest Little Moon records ({n})", "打开这一页时会自动在后台从小月亮拉一次；停在这里、小月亮那边又有新记录时，点按钮再拉。": "Opening this page pulls from Little Moon in the background; if new records appear there while you stay here, tap the button to pull again.", "下面每个话题会显示小月亮里相关的记录（情绪、自律、屏幕、情绪行为），打开这一页时自动从小月亮拉一次。这里记的情绪管理记录只存在家庭学堂，不写进小月亮。": "Each topic below shows related Little Moon records (mood, habits, screens, behaviour), pulled automatically when you open this page. Emotion logs made here stay in Family Homeschool and are not written to Little Moon.", "情绪管理": "Emotion care", "话题": "Topics", "平时怎么陪伴": "How to accompany day to day", "怒气来时怎么办": "When anger comes", "冲突管理讲的是「事情发生了，当场怎么办」；持续的情绪和习惯（嫉妒、焦虑、屏幕……）在「情绪管理」。以下依据儿童发展的一般共识（AAP、CDC 等的公开育儿建议），只作参考，不是诊断。每个孩子不一样；持续而严重时，请找儿科医生或儿童心理专业人员。": "Conflict care is about “it happened, what now”; ongoing feelings and habits (jealousy, anxiety, screens…) are under Emotion care. The following follows general child-development consensus (public parenting guidance from AAP, CDC and others), for reference, not diagnosis. Every child differs; if it is persistent and severe, see a paediatrician or child-psychology professional.", "情绪管理讲的是「持续的情绪、态度和习惯，平时怎么陪伴」；一件事当场发生了怎么办，在「冲突管理」。情绪不是要消灭，是要被看见、被陪伴，再带到神面前。以下依据儿童发展的一般共识，只作参考，不是诊断。": "Emotion care is about ongoing feelings, attitudes and habits and how to accompany them; what to do when something happens on the spot is under Conflict care. Feelings are not to be eliminated but seen, accompanied, and brought before God. Based on general child-development consensus; for reference, not diagnosis.", "孩子最近在「{s}」这方面让我有些担心。请结合他的年龄、我们家已经试过的做法和结果，以及我（大人）自己的状态，告诉我平时可以怎么陪伴他。": "I’m a bit worried about my child’s “{s}”. Considering their age, what we have tried and how it went, and my own state, how can I accompany them day to day?", "近 30 天屏幕共 {a} 分钟，日均 {b} 分钟": "Screens in the last 30 days: {a} min in total, {b} min a day", "小月亮里近 60 天没有屏幕记录（在小月亮「活动 → 屏幕」记）": "No screen records in Little Moon for 60 days (log under Activity → Screen there)", "还没有记录。点话题上的「记一笔」；过去的也能补。": "Nothing logged yet. Tap “Log it” on a topic; past ones can be backfilled.", "嫉妒": "Jealousy", "我们的根基": "Our foundation",

